          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: उचकी लागणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उचकी लागणे — uckī lāgṇe — \"to have hiccups\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घाईत जेवल्याने त्याला उचकी लागली. ghāīt jevlyāne tyālā uckī lāglī. Eating in a hurry gave him hiccups."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (to him …): त्याला उचकी लागली, tyālā uckī lāglī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dative: मला उचकी लागली."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उचकी लागणे (uckī lāgṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on उचकी, \"a hiccup\", whose origin is not settled, with लागणे."
            }
          ]
        },
