        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ढेकर देणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ढेकर देणे — ḍhekar deṇe — \"to burp\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पोटभर जेवल्यावर आजोबांनी ढेकर दिली. poṭbhar jevlyāvar ājobānnī ḍhekar dilī. After a full meal Grandfather burped."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने ढेकर दिली, tyāne ḍhekar dilī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ढेकर, a burp, is feminine in everyday use (ढेकर आली, ढेकर दिली), though CDIAL marks it masculine. ढेकर येणे, with the dative."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ढेकर देणे (ḍhekar deṇe) is a Marathi phrase built on ढेकर, \"a burp\", which is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi ḍhẽkar, \"belch\", under ḍakkāra (CDIAL 5521); देणे is the light verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
